# Cove

This machine runs Cove — a local developer platform (forge, vault, CI, registry, pages). All services are offline-first.

- **Forgejo** at `https://git.cove.local/` (TLS via cove certs). CLI: `fj` (auto-detects host from git remote).
- **Vault** at `https://vault.cove.local/` (TLS via cove certs). Use `cove creds vault-get` / `cove creds vault-put` — never hardcode secrets.
- **Prerequisites (macOS):** `brew install colima && colima start`
- **Constraints:** No cloud dependencies. No internet during builds/CI. All git remotes go to Forgejo.
